    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop playing the game altogether\"... that sounds a lot like giving up. but honestly, it's the only thing that makes sense right now. if the only options are to slowly rot in mediocrity or to just exit before it gets even worse, why is everyone so obsessed with the \"slow rot\"? isn't there more dignity in just choosing when you've had enough?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
